    "The 韭 Debacle": "Every honest colleague systematically dismantled 韭, pointing out that 韭 has 5–7 horizontals and only 2 vertical backbones—the exact inverse of the riddle's 3 horizontals and 8 verticals. Our 'stroke purity / 横折' argument fell completely flat against the overwhelming geometric and numerical fit of 带.",
